---
description: "Always-on pointer to the shared AGENTS.md rules"
globs: ["**/*"]
alwaysApply: true
---
Read and follow ./AGENTS.md at the project root for coding, git, and command
conventions (verify / double check / refactor / test / debug / optimize /
explain / docs / security / commit / rephrase).
It is the shared rules file used across Cursor, Antigravity, Gemini CLI, Kiro,
and Claude Code. Do not duplicate its content here; just follow it.

Hard rule regardless of any other default: never add `Co-authored-by` or
"Generated with Cursor" trailers to commit messages.
